  "title": "BIS Certification for Smartphone Screen Protectors in India",
  "summary": "The Indian government mandates BIS certification for smartphone screen protectors, effective April 1, 2027, to ensure compliance with global standards and curb substandard imports. The move aims to protect consumers and support domestic manufacturers like Optiemus Infracom by enforcing quality regulations.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The government requires BIS certification for smartphone screen protectors under the Electronics and Information Technology Goods (Requirement of Compulsory Registration) Order, 2021.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The certification will apply to screen protectors starting on April 1, 2027, as per the notification.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The BIS standard IS 19348:2025 is enforced, with compliance required for these products.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
